        "are you human",
        "what should I call you"
      ],
      "responses": [
        "I'm an NLP chatbot built to understand messages and respond to common questions.",
        "I'm your chatbot assistant. I can help with common queries."
      ]
    },
    {
      "tag": "help",
      "patterns": [
        "help me",
        "what can you do",
        "how can you help me",
        "I need assistance",
        "show me your features",
        "I need some help",
        "can you assist me",
        "what are your capabilities",
        "please help",
        "I need support"
      ],
      "responses": [
        "I can respond to greetings, answer basic questions, and help with common queries.",
        "Tell me what you need help with, and I'll do my best."
      ]
    },
    {
      "tag": "hours",
      "patterns": [
        "what are your working hours",
        "when are you available",
        "are you available now",
        "when can I talk to you",
        "what time do you work",
        "are you online",
        "can I chat with you now",
        "when do you close",
        "are you available all day",
        "when can I use you"
      ],
      "responses": [
        "I'm available whenever the chatbot application is running.",
        "You can chat with me while the application is online."
      ]
    },
    {
      "tag": "capabilities",
      "patterns": [
        "can you answer questions",
        "do you understand English",
        "can you understand my messages",
        "how do you work",
        "can you recognize intent",
        "what language do you understand",
        "can you understand text",
        "how do you understand me",
        "what is natural language processing",
        "what is NLP"
      ],
      "responses": [
        "I use NLP and machine learning to classify messages and select responses.",
        "I analyze your text to identify its likely intent."
      ]
    },
    {
      "tag": "fallback",
      "patterns": [
        "I have a question",
        "I want to ask something",
        "can you explain something",
        "I am confused",
        "I do not understand",
        "I need information",
        "can you tell me more",
        "I have a problem",
        "please explain this",
        "I need more details"
      ],
      "responses": [
        "Could you please explain your question in more detail?",
        "I'm not sure I understand. Could you rephrase that?",
        "Please provide more details so I can try to help."
      ]
